eip-1193-provider — vendored, native-only fork
==============================================

This crate is a native-only fork of the `eip-1193-provider` crate from
ethereum/kohaku (https://github.com/ethereum/kohaku), git revision
618c53facd0d44cf0f01d74e0dcc18d2242351c7. The Rust sources under src/ are copied
verbatim from that revision; the ONLY change is dropping the wasm32-only `js`
Cargo feature and its wasm-bindgen dependencies (see Cargo.toml for the full
rationale). No functional native code was modified.

Provenance / license: Kohaku declares its license as MIT in its repository-root
package.json ("license": "MIT"). The upstream repository does not ship a
standalone LICENSE file or a per-crate `license` field, so the MIT license text
is reproduced below to satisfy redistribution. Copyright is held by the Kohaku
contributors. (Maintainer note: confirm the MIT designation with the Kohaku
maintainers before or shortly after publishing — tracked in the W0 launch-blocker
notes.)

